  "steps": [
    "In a spoonful of the oil, roast the coriander seeds, dried red chillies, cumin, fenugreek and pepper until aromatic.",
    "Add the grated coconut and roast until golden, cool and grind with the turmeric, tamarind and a splash of water to a coarse paste.",
    "Heat the remaining oil, add the curry leaves, onions, garlic and ginger and cook until the onions turn golden.",
    "Add the chicken and salt and cook on medium heat for 10 minutes.",
    "Stir in the ground masala with a few tablespoons of water, cover and cook 15 minutes until the chicken is tender.",
    "Uncover and stir-fry on higher heat until the masala is dry and coats each piece."
  ]
